Android Skills
==============

The skill content in this package comes from the android/skills repository:

    https://github.com/android/skills

    Copyright Google LLC
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE.txt)
    Source commit: 6daa53e (upstream plugin version 1.0.19)
    Packaged for DeepSeek Harness as dsh-android-skills 1.0.19

The skill content is redistributed unmodified. The only packaging change is
that the 36 skill directories, which upstream organizes under category
directories (for example jetpack-compose/adaptive or wear/wear-compose-m3),
are placed at the top level of the skills/ directory, because the DeepSeek
Harness skill filesystem provider only discovers skills at the top level of
a scanned root.

